# The build context is the repository root (deploy/Dockerfile), so everything
# not needed to compile the server or build the web front end is excluded here.
# `target/` alone reaches roughly 20 GB on a full debug build, and sending it to
# the daemon costs more than the build.

target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

.git/
.github/
.idea/
.claude/

# Built inside the image; a stale local copy must never be picked up instead.
frontend/web/layout-proof/

crates/desktop/gen/

*.md
docs/
# Every .env at every depth, not only the one at the context root. The
# deployment instructions ask for `deploy/.env`, and a bare `.env` pattern here
# matches the root file alone — so the compose secrets would have been copied
# into the planner and builder stages by `COPY . .` and kept in the build cache.
# They never reached the final image; that is not the same as never leaving the
# machine.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
